app/ui/pixel.c and app/ui/pixel.h follow the look of BananaOS's own menus and
apps from BananaLinux (MIT): the palette and the accents of settings_pal.cpp,
the row and key-hint layout of RndsUI.cpp, and the box painter of the
Activity app (store/apps/activity).
Copyright (c) 2026 JorreFog and the Banana contributors.

app/ui/third_party/stb_truetype.h is public domain (Sean Barrett).

The on-screen app draws with libdrm. Its colours are BananaOS's palette, the
same values BananaDS's menu uses. The typeface is Pixelify Sans, already on
the handheld at /usr/share/banana/rnds/fonts.
